"""G2 round 1 — curation input for the mapping base (2026-10-10).

Every judgement in this file was entered by the programming agent (Claude Code)
after reading captured evidence. Nothing here was confirmed by a researcher:
the builder writes classification_basis=AGENT_PROVISIONAL and
researcher_confirmed=NO on every row.

Value tags (last two characters of a value) say where the value comes from:
    |P  read by the agent in a captured primary page (hash in evidence_registry)
    |M  machine metadata returned by a repository or catalogue API (stored response)
    |S  carried over from the seed inventory, not verified
    |I  agent inference, not supported by a captured statement
Untagged structural fields (category, set, status) are agent proposals by definition.
A field that is absent is written as NOT_ASSESSED: not collected, which is not
the same as not existing.
"""

